#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/external.rst:4
msgid "External Kubernetes Clusters"
msgstr "Externo Kubernetes Clusters"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/external.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/external.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports two primary modes of Kubernetes cluster management:"
msgstr "|morpheus| soporta two primario modos de Kubernetes cluster gestión:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/external.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Provisioned Clusters** — Kubernetes clusters provisioned directly by "
"|morpheus| using MKS (Morpheus Kubernetes Service) layouts"
msgstr ""
"**Aprovisionado Clústeres** — Kubernetes clusters aprovisionado directamente"
" por |morpheus| usando MKS (Morpheus Kubernetes Servicio) layouts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/external.rst:12
msgid ""
"**External Clusters** — Pre-existing Kubernetes clusters provisioned outside"
" of |morpheus| and imported for management"
msgstr ""
"**External Clústeres** — Pre-existente Kubernetes clusters aprovisionado "
"outside de |morpheus| y imported para gestión"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/external.rst:14
msgid ""
"This guide covers the differences between these approaches, the import "
"process for external clusters, and the feature parity between the two."
msgstr ""
"Este guide covers el differences entre estos approaches, el import proceso "
"para externo clusters, y el función parity entre el two."

